] = new ArrayList<>();\n                cost[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n                cap[i] = new ArrayList<>();\n            }\n        }\n\n        static void add_edge(int x, int y, int c, int w) {\n            rev[x].add(v[y].size());\n            rev[y].add(v[x].size());\n            v[x].add(y);\n            v[y].add(x);\n            cost[x].add(w);\n            cost[y].add(-w);\n            cap[x].add(c);\n            cap[y].add(0);\n        }\n\n        static void spfa(int s) {\n            Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE / 2);\n            Arrays.fill(vis, 0);\n            prex[s] = -1;\n            Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n            q.add(s);\n            dist[s] = 0;\n            vis[s] = 1;\n            while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n                int x = q.poll();\n                vis[x] = 0;\n                for (int i = 0; i < v[x].size(); i++) {\n                    int y = v[x].get(i);\n                    int cc = dist[x] + cost[x].get(i);\n                    if (dist[y] > cc && cap[x].get(i) > 0) {\n                        dist[y] = cc;\n                        prex[y] = x;\n                        prei[y] = i;\n                        if (vis[y] == 0) {\n                            vis[y] = 1;\n                            q.add(y);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        static int dfs(int x, int flow) {\n            if (prex[x] == -1) return flow;\n            int y = x;\n            x = prex[y];\n            int i = prei[y];\n            int j = rev[x].get(i);\n            int f = dfs(x, Math.min(flow, cap[x].get(i)));\n            cap[x].set(i, cap[x].get(i) - f);\n            cap[y].set(j, cap[y].get(j) + f);\n            return f;\n        }\n\n        static int[] solve(int s, int t) {\n            int ans = 0;\n            tot = 0;\n            while (true) {\n                spfa(s);\n                if (dist[t] > 1e9) break;\n                int f = dfs(t, 100000000);\n                tot += f * dist[t];\n                ans += f;\n            }\n            return new int[]{ans, tot};\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        MCMF.init();\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        int k = sc.nextInt();\n        int c = sc.nextInt();\n        int d = sc.nextInt();\n        int kk = k;\n        int s = MCMF.nn - 1;\n        int t = MCMF.nn - 2;\n        while (k-- > 0) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt();\n            MCMF.add_edge(s, get(x, 1), 1, 0);\n        }\n        k = kk;\n        while (m-- > 0) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt();\n            int y = sc.nextInt();\n            for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= k; j++) {\n                    MCMF.add_edge(get(x, i), get(y, i + 1), 1, d * (j + j - 1));\n                }\n            }\n            // swap\n            int tmp = x; x = y; y = tmp;\n            for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= k; j++) {\n                    MCMF.add_edge(get(x, i), get(y, i + 1), 1, d * (j + j - 1));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        for (int i = 1; i < 100; i++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n                MCMF.add_edge(get(j, i), get(j, i + 1), 100000000, 0);\n            }\n            MCMF.add_edge(get(1, i), t, 100000000, c * (i - 1));\n        }\n        int[] result = MCMF.solve(s, t);\n        System.out.println(result[1]);\n    }\n\n    static int get(int x, int tim) {\n        return tim * 52 - 52 + x;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.867782187531702e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00014172980445437133, -5.674201020156033e-05, 0.0, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.007416217587888241, -0.04929850250482559, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0036795311607420444, -0.003183061955496669, -0.0009142747730948031, -0.002207463607